# Fate's Edge Toolkit — Software License (Code Only)

This file covers **software source code only** — the application logic that
makes the toolkit (web client, socket server, bots, CLI/desktop clients,
build tooling) run. It does **not** cover game content (rules text, setting
lore, characters, data files); see [LICENSE.srd](LICENSE.srd) and
[LICENSE.proprietary](LICENSE.proprietary) for that, and
[COMMUNITY_USE_POLICY.md](COMMUNITY_USE_POLICY.md) for a plain-language
breakdown of which is which and what you can do with each.

